<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Static sitemap for e-Sauda. This is a client-side SPA (Vite + React Router),
  so this file lists only the fixed, publicly-crawlable routes -- not per-listing
  or per-seller pages (/listing/:id, /seller/:id), which are dynamic and would
  need a server-generated sitemap to enumerate properly. Auth-gated routes
  (messages, sell, my-listings, orders, vault, profile, saved, admin) are
  intentionally excluded since they require login and aren't meant to be indexed.

  Update the <lastmod> dates when a page's content changes meaningfully.
-->
